      <h1 class="page-title">A cabinet maker in the Calder Valley</h1>
      <p class="lede">I'm Joel Dyter. I've worked as a joiner and cabinet maker for more than {{ site.yearsTrade }} years, and I've run my own business since {{ site.established }}, first from a workshop in Old Town and now from Unit 7 on the Pennine Industrial Estate in Hebden Bridge.</p>
