<section class="section">
  <div class="container split split--reverse">
    <div class="split__media">{% image "/images/projects/bespoke-oak-desk/03.jpg", "Hand-cut dovetails on a drawer box in the workshop", "(min-width: 900px) 45vw, 100vw" %}</div>
    <div class="split__text prose">
      <h2 class="section-title">Working with one craftsman</h2>
      <p>I work on my own, which means the person who visits your home, draws the design, chooses the timber, makes each piece and fits it is the same person throughout. You always know who to speak to, and the ideas we agree at the start are carried right through to the finished room.</p>
      <p>It also means I take on a limited number of projects at a time, so each one gets the attention it deserves. I would rather do fewer jobs well than hurry any of them.</p>
      <p>I use the best timber and fittings I can source, because the furniture I make is meant to be lived with for a long time. Whether you are thinking of a whole kitchen or a single bookcase, traditional or contemporary, I'm always happy to talk it through.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">How I work</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">What to expect</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>Conversation</h3><p>Get in touch by phone, WhatsApp or the enquiry form and tell me what you have in mind.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Photos &amp; site visit</h3><p>A few photos give me a first idea of the room. I'll then visit to measure up and see how you use the space.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Estimate</h3><p>An early estimate gives you a sense of the cost before any detailed design work begins.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Drawings</h3><p>I draw up the design, so you can see how each piece will look and fit the room.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Final price &amp; agreement</h3><p>Once the design is settled, we agree the build price. Changes requested mid-build, and the cost of fitting, may vary depending on the work involved.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Made by hand</h3><p>Cabinets and furniture are made by hand in my Hebden Bridge workshop.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Fitting</h3><p>I fit each piece myself, scribing it to your walls and floors so it sits neatly in the room.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="steps__note">{{ site.bookingNote }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

